@startuml
!include ../common/style.puml

title HANBAY HOTEL - Booking State Machine

hide empty description

[*] --> PENDING : create booking\n[room inventory available]

state PENDING
state CONFIRMED
state CHECKED_IN
state CHECKED_OUT
state CANCELLED
state EXPIRED

PENDING --> CONFIRMED : payment confirmed\n[before expiresAt]
PENDING --> CANCELLED : guest cancels
PENDING --> EXPIRED : payment timeout\n[now >= expiresAt]
PENDING --> CANCELLED : payment rejected / booking invalid

CONFIRMED --> CHECKED_IN : receptionist checks in\n[room assigned and AVAILABLE]
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : cancellation accepted\n[policy allows]

CHECKED_IN --> CHECKED_OUT : receptionist checks out\n[no outstanding balance]

CANCELLED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
CHECKED_OUT --> [*]

note right of PENDING
  A newly created booking holds inventory
  for at most 15 minutes.

  Counted in availability while:
  status = PENDING and expiresAt > now.
end note

note right of CONFIRMED
  Payment has been confirmed.
  Physical room assignment may happen
  before or during check-in.
end note

note right of CHECKED_IN
  The assigned physical room is OCCUPIED.
  Cancellation is no longer permitted.
end note

note right of CHECKED_OUT
  The guest has left.
  The room becomes DIRTY. This is the
  terminal successful booking state.
end note

note bottom of CANCELLED
  Booking was cancelled explicitly or invalidated.
  Inventory hold is released.
  Refund handling, when applicable,
  belongs to the payment lifecycle.
end note

note bottom of EXPIRED
  Payment was not confirmed before expiresAt.
  The RoomType inventory hold is released.
  No physical Room needs to be unassigned.
end note

legend bottom
  == Transition guard examples ==
  [room inventory available] : availability is rechecked inside a transaction
  [before expiresAt]          : expired bookings cannot be confirmed
  [policy allows]             : cancellation policy is satisfied
endlegend

@enduml
